{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":60,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["錫安將來的榮耀"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["起來，發光吧！因為你的光已經來到，",{"text":"耶和華的榮耀光照你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，黑暗遮蓋大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幽暗籠罩萬民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和華必光照你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的榮耀必顯在你身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國要來就你的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王要來就你的曙光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「舉目四望吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾人正聚到你面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的兒子們從遠方來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的女兒們被護送回來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你看見後就容光煥發，心花怒放，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為海上的貨物要歸給你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國的財富都要歸給你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"米甸和以法的駱駝必成群結隊而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"佈滿你的地面；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"示巴人都必帶著黃金和乳香來頌讚耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基達的羊群必聚集到你那裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尼拜約的公羊必供你使用，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們在我的壇上必蒙悅納。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我榮美的殿更榮美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「這些好像雲彩飛來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像鴿子飛回巢穴的是誰？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾海島都等候我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他施的船隻領航，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從遠處把你的兒子和他們的金銀一同帶來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以尊崇你的上帝耶和華——以色列的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂已經使你得到榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"「外族人要為你建造城牆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的君王要服侍你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾發怒擊打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今我要施恩憐憫你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的城門要一直敞開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晝夜不關，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好讓列國的君王帶著百姓和財物前來向你朝貢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不事奉你的邦國都必滅亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被徹底摧毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩引以為榮的松樹、杉樹和黃楊樹都要運到你這裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用來裝飾我的聖所；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我腳踏之處充滿榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欺壓你之人的子孫要來向你下拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐視你的人要在你腳前跪拜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要稱你為耶和華的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列聖者的錫安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"「雖然你曾被撇棄、被厭惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人從你那裡經過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我要使你永遠尊貴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世世代代都充滿歡樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必吸各國的乳汁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃列王的奶水。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，你就知道我耶和華是你的救主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的大能者是你的救贖主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「我要帶給你金子，而非銅；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶給你銀子，而非鐵；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶給你銅，而非木頭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶給你鐵，而非石頭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使和平做你的官長，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使公義做你的首領。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你國中再沒有暴力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境內再沒有破壞和毀滅的事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必給你的城牆取名叫『拯救』，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給你的城門取名叫『讚美』。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「太陽不再作你白晝的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"月亮也不再給你光輝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華要作你永遠的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的上帝要成為你的榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的太陽不再落下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的月亮也不再消失，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華要作你永遠的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你悲哀的日子將要結束。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的人民都必成為義人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永遠擁有這土地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們是我栽種的樹苗，是我手中的工作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以彰顯我的榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"最小的家族要變成千人大族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"最弱的一國要成為強國。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"時候一到，我耶和華必迅速成就這些事。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/60.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/61.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/59.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}